        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"30993\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The token win against the Fey-Court is really fun, really satisfying, but it also takes a really long damn time. D:</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>My first game against them, yes. Three or more hours and caused some friends to vow never to play SotM with me again.</p>\n<p>The second game, we won by tokens on either the second or third round. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/man_shrugging/2.png?v=12\" title=\":man_shrugging:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":man_shrugging:t2:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> So mercurial and capricious are good descriptors here.</p>",
